    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79926" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάσμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sprinkling</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλμης πάσμασι σῶμα λιπάνας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Axionic.
					4.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> Medic.,
				<i>powder</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Posidon.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				6.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Alex.
			</span></i> Trall.<i><span class="en">
				12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πεῖσμα</span>
			, <i>leaf-stalk</i>, also, <i>flock of wool</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> dub. sens. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ostr.Bodl.</u>
				i306
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i B.C.)</span>.</div>
